msgstr "SteamVR Vive Tracker（`vive_tracker_teleop`）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md 07a7a70bdbe04c20bd7ab5be2d916f7f
msgid ""
"Arm end-effector pose. Named **Vive Tracker** in the package and in these"
" docs, not “Valve Tracker”."
msgstr "手臂末端位姿。软件包和本文档中的名称是 **Vive Tracker**，而不是 “Valve Tracker”。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md 2b2eef7a586b4975b9d3da47a5e739a2
msgid "Foot pedal"
msgstr "脚踏板"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md e872ac15499b482dacef287c67d06bdd
msgid "USB pedal (`arms_teleop`, SayoDevice CM6K)"
